.TH SETFSGID 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
setfsgid \- attempts to set the filesystem group id
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/fsuid.h>
.B gid_t setfsgid(gid_t group);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Attempts to set the filesystem group ID. Linux returns the previous ID even when the change is refused; this call does not report failure through errno.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the value described above; errno is not modified.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setfsgid (2)
